	JMS	PRMULT	/THE SIZE OF THE TOP MARGIN
		PRQTMG

	DCA	PRQTMG	/SAVE IT AWAY

	TAD   (PRNLSZ)
	JMS	PRMULT	/THE SIZE OF THE BOTTOM MARGIN
		PRQBMG

	DCA	PRQBMG	/SAVE IT AWAY

	TAD    (PRNHL)
