/ FOLLOWS: 	UPPER BYTE    LOWER BYTE				/A221
/              SIXBIT LETTER  SIXBIT ZERO				/A221
/ THE IAC BSW IN THE FOLLOWING CODE WILL CONVERT THIS VALUE INTO	/A221
