/2.4-2	KEE	10/3/77		DISALLOW 'PI 0', AND DISALLOW PROPORTIONAL PITCH
/				FOR 100 AND WS78 SYSTEMS
/2.4-1	LDB	9/29/77		FIX 102 PRINTER LOCKS
/2.Q-1	LDB	9/25/77		PUT IN PRINTER LOCKS
/2.P-7	LDB	9/23/77		FIX BUG IN RL/SL MENU
/2.P-6	RLT	9/20/77		CHANGE PS1,PS2 FOR NEW STOP REASON (7)
/2.P-5	LDB	9/20/77		CHANGE CM1, RS1, AND LP2 FOR SL & RL
/2.P-4	KEE	9/17/77		PUT 'CX' MENUS INTO MN
/2.P-1	LDB	9/16/77		PUT IN MORE RL & SL CODE AND ASSORTED CHANGES
/2.N-5	KEE	9/15/77		MORE MENU CLEAN UP FOR 2.5
/2.N-1	RLT	9/14/77		ADD UDKPRT STUFF
/2.N	LDB	9/14/77		CHANGE CMND CALLS BECAUSE OF
/				MOVE FROM CUT TO CU2
/2.J   LB&KE	8/19/77		 ASSORTED CHANGES FOR 2.5
/2.G-3	MB	8/13/77		PUT NEW FORM OR WPCU2 IN IT IS NOW 3 OVERLAYS
/2.G-2	MB	8/11/77		PUT IN THE INDEX TO DOCUMENT CHANGE
/2.G-1	RLT	8/8/77		LA180P COMMENT IN RD MENU

