/ RTXTOP - RESTORE TEXT OPTIONS
/ --------------------------
/
RTXTOP,	0
	JMS I	XMOVE		/MOVE MEMORY AROUND
	TXTSAV-1		/  FROM SAVE BUFFER
	ZCHRST-1		/  TO ACTIVE TEXT OPTIONS
	ZTXTSZ			/  THIS MANY WORDS
/
	JMS	ZCOPYT		/COPY PARAMETERS TO MAIN FIELD
/
	JMP I	RTXTOP		/RETURN
